This is actually my second ascension. My first ascension was on December 6, 
2007, with a chaotic human monk. It took me around 5 years to ascend my first 
character, then less than 3 weeks to ascend my second. Weird. Unfortunately, I 
didn't have the "dump" patch installed when I ascended my first character, and 
I was playing on my local machine, so I didn't post the YAFAP since I didn't 
have a screenshot to show.

Anyway, I have since installed the "dump" patch. This neutral wizard was a blast
 to play. It's true what they say - wizards have devilishly hard early games, 
but once you get crowned and get the Eye, it's a lot of fun! I didn't take a lot
 of notes during this game, since I wasn't sure I was going to ascend. I can 
post the story if anyone's really interested, but for now, enjoy the screenshot!

